A task box names an unresolved image by its alt as written

```
- [ ] ![x][r]
.
<ul class="task-list">
  <li><input type="checkbox" disabled aria-label="x"> ![x][r]</li>
</ul>
```

```
- [ ] ![/x/ y][r] z
.
<ul class="task-list">
  <li><input type="checkbox" disabled aria-label="/x/ y z"> ![/x/ y][r] z</li>
</ul>
```
